WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.283
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:07.300
SPEAKER: Data.

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:10.910
It's the great differentiator in
today's competitive landscape.

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:13.900
Every day, your business pulls
in huge quantities of it,

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:16.400
from web interactions
to inventory counts,

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:19.340
diagnostic reports
to consumer feedback.

00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:23.090
And then it sits,
separated across systems,

00:00:23.090 --> 00:00:25.340
unstructured, and disjointed.

00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:28.190
Being able to look out
across all that data,

00:00:28.190 --> 00:00:30.770
connect the dots, and
see the bigger picture

00:00:30.770 --> 00:00:34.120
is key to your company's
success and survival.

00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:37.060
Machine learning gives
you this ability--

00:00:37.060 --> 00:00:39.860
the chance to view your
data in a whole new way.

00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:42.080
Instead of following
code and commands,

00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:45.140
it learns from what you compile
to find patterns and insights

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:48.200
that not only make you
smarter, but can revolutionize

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:49.685
how your business runs.

00:00:49.685 --> 00:00:51.770
At Google, we use
machine learning

00:00:51.770 --> 00:00:55.790
to optimize all our products,
from real-time traffic in Maps,

00:00:55.790 --> 00:00:59.860
spam detection in Gmail, and
facial recognition in Photos.

00:00:59.860 --> 00:01:02.540
And now we've designed a
platform especially for you.

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:05.000
Predict when to
ramp up production.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:07.580
Know when your customers
are ready to upgrade.

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:10.860
Diagnose new diseases
with speed and accuracy.

00:01:10.860 --> 00:01:13.460
The more data you bring to
it, the more unique insights

00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:15.530
you're given, the
more opportunities

00:01:15.530 --> 00:01:19.190
you have to redefine how
your enterprise runs.

00:01:19.190 --> 00:01:21.410
This is the future of how
machines and people work

00:01:21.410 --> 00:01:24.160
together to transform
how we all do business.

00:01:24.160 --> 00:01:27.410
The technology is here
and it's waiting for you.

00:01:27.410 --> 00:01:30.910
Will it make the difference
for your enterprise?

